{
  "bodyHash": "3uGT1EuTzqk=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p6HnjKT.png\" alt=\"\"></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><strong>用你想要的方式表達自我！</strong></span><br><br></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-NeoForge | Fabric-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.20.1 | 1.21.1 | 1.21.11-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"272\" height=\"28\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Architectury API-required-ecebe6?labelColor=fc7200&amp;style=for-the-badge\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Server side-required-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Client side-required-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&amp;style=for-the-badge\"><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AKMkECwnqf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973266096763318303?color=7289DA&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge\"></a></div><p>&nbsp;undefined</p><hr><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\"><strong>告訴玩家你的人稱代詞</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">選擇一個預設或使用你自己的！</span><br><br><img style=\"border:5px solid black\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/546JrJ6.png\" width=\"50%\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\"><strong>展現你有多自豪</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">你可以從眾多選擇中展示最多兩面驕傲旗幟！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">旗幟的位置也可以調整。</span><br><br><img style=\"border:5px solid black\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5VxICBH.png\" width=\"45%\"> <img style=\"border:5px solid black\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FGAO6TY.png\" width=\"45%\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:large\">其他玩家也將能看到你的旗幟</span><br><br><img style=\"border:5px solid black\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rPbeBoQ.png\" width=\"60%\"></div><p>undefined&nbsp;</p><div><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\"><strong>重要提醒！</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">有些玩家可能會惡意行為，因此 SYI 配有「髒話過濾器」</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">預設情況下，有超過 500 個單詞被禁止使用。這些包括同性戀恐懼和跨性別恐懼的歧視用語，以及來自法西斯等仇恨意識形態的詞彙。你可以透過使用 <strong>/syi</strong> 指令或手動新增單詞到列表中，自由添加你想要的詞彙以創造安全的空間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">檔案可以在你的 <strong>.../config/</strong> 目錄中找到，名稱為 <strong>slurs_filter.txt</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">如果找不到該檔案，資料將從 GitHub 儲存庫 <strong>sawdev1/better-profane-words</strong> 生成。</span></div><p>undefined</p><hr><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><div><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><strong>玩家指令</strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:large\">（任何人都能使用）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">查詢玩家的代詞</span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>/syi pronouns get &lt;player&gt;</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">設定自己的代詞</span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>/syi pronouns set &lt;pronouns&gt;</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">重設自己的代詞</span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>/syi pronouns reset</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">設定自己的驕傲旗幟</span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>/syi flag set &lt;primary|secondary&gt; &lt;flag&gt;</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">重設自己的驕傲旗幟</span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>/syi flag reset &lt;primary|secondary&gt;</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">調整驕傲旗幟的位置</span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>/syi flag position &lt;player_name|pronouns&gt;</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">查看旗幟以及其身分/取向的簡短說明</span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>/syi flag info &lt;flag&gt;</strong></span></div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><div><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><strong>管理員指令</strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:large\">（OP 能夠使用）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">重設玩家的身分資料</span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>/syi reset player &lt;player&gt;</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">重設所有玩家的身分資料</span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>/syi reset all</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">添加你不希望玩家設為代詞的單詞（主要是歧視用語）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>/syi slur_filter add &lt;word&gt;</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">重新載入髒話過濾檔案</span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>/syi slur_filter reload</strong></span></div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><div><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><strong>支援的語言</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1fa-1f1f8.png\" width=\"32\"></div><p><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1e9-1f1ea.png\" width=\"32\"> \n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <strong>與 Lusobit Studio 合作翻譯</strong>\n    </p><div>\n        <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1e7-1f1f7.png\" width=\"32\">\n         由 <a href=\"https://github.com/EUSOUEFEMERO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@EUSOUEFEMERO</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/iago\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@iago</a>_emanuel15\n    </div><div>\n        <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1e6-1f1f7.png\" width=\"32\">\n         由 <a href=\"https://github.com/franstachiotti\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@franstachiotti</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/firemortal10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@firemortal10</a>\n    </div><div>\n        <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1ee-1f1f9.png\" width=\"32\">\n         由 <a href=\"https://github.com/milomiletto\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@milomiletto</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/PieroAzZZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@PieroAzZZ</a>\n    </div><div>\n        <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1e8-1f1f3.png\" width=\"32\">\n         由 <a href=\"https://github.com/daisy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@daisy</a>_comment\n    </div><div>\n        <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1ef-1f1f5.png\" width=\"32\">\n         由 <a href=\"https://github.com/ashwall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@ashwall</a>_penguin\n    </div><div>\n        <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1eb-1f1f7.png\" width=\"32\">\n         由 <a href=\"https://github.com/RoseDorleans\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@RoseDorleans</a>\n    </div><p></p>",
